ngs.\\nLight and heat serve as messengers and heralds, conveying orders to flames in many-formed flow.\\nThen, the great king establishes here a repository for all memories and wisdom.","nextNodeIds":[751900203]},{"nodeId":751900203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":3574433450,"text":"Thus is the Sacred City of Tollan created. Thus did it don its original form.\\nThis is the first memory preserved in the lake of blazing fire.","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":7519003,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":true,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":true,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7519002","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["7517501","1","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR_EQUAL"},{"param":["45003031","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_IN_VEHICLE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_AND","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_LOCAL","id":7519003,"initDialog":751900301,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[21806],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Natlan_75190/Q7519003","priority":5,"questId":75190,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":751900301,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":2066701146,"text":"As you immerse yourself in the liquid Phlogiston, images flash through your mind like warm memories.","nextNodeIds":[751900302]},{"nodeId":751900302,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":3375104018,"text":"Many dragons once immersed themselves in the lake of flame, and thus did the information and wisdom carried within the liquid Phlogiston flow into their minds.\\nBut that was in ages past. None now come to this place to seek wisdom.\\nInstead, these crystallizations of sagacity came to be used as proofs of strength... To think that such objects that might push an entire species into the next generation would be used as naught but weapons!","nextNodeIds":[751900303]},{"nodeId":751900303,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":1372445730,"text":"When the flame-lord of the many dragons feigned death on account of the pitch-black shadow that plagued him, when the human populace outside the volcano raised their banners of resistance...\\nPerhaps only violence could have suppressed the unease that people felt in their hearts.","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":7519004,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":true,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":true,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7519002","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["7517501","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR_EQUAL"},{"param":["45003031","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_IN_VEHICLE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_AND","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_LOCAL","id":7519004,"initDialog":751900401,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[21806],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Natlan_75190/Q7519004","priority":5,"questId":75190,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":751900401,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":1077498386,"text":"As you immerse yourself in the liquid Phlogiston, images flash through your mind like warm memories.","nextNodeIds":[751900402]},{"nodeId":751900402,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":284571210,"text":"It has been many years since the Pyro Dragon Sovereign and the first human god tumbled together into the volcano's depths.\\nThe Sacred City is pitch-dark, having been sealed. Whether through the loss of the primal flame or to adapt to realms now ruled by humanity, the ancient dragons have forsaken both wisdom and form. Others were reduced to ash when the furnace blazing in their breasts burned out.\\nThe silver-white shadow steps alone into the turbulent blazing pool that lies within the ever-more-solitary city.","nextNodeIds":[751900403]},{"nodeId":751900403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":3077015922,"text":"He knows he can no longer obtain new wisdom from it.\\nBut why, he asks himself.\\n\"Perhaps it is because memory, too, is a hard-to-come-by experience.\"\\nSo he replies in self-mockery, for there are many figures he can now only meet here.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7519002,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7519003,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7519004,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["7517501","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_INC_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["101","610101009"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_NOTIFY_GROUP_LUA"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}},{"subQuestId":7519003,"order":3,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":3478145412,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[610101009,9024],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_GADGET_STATE_CHA